---
// src/components/About.astro
// Edit bio text and degrees here
const degrees = [
  { deg: 'MS · Artificial Intelligence',  school: 'University of the Cumberlands · USA', year: '2024–2026' },
  { deg: 'MS · Information Technology',   school: 'University of the Cumberlands · USA', year: '2022–2024' },
  { deg: 'BE · Civil Engineering',   school: 'Osmania University · India', year: '2017–2021' },
];
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="sec-tag">01</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title" data-splitting>About</h2>
      <div class="sec-divider"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text" data-reveal="left">
      <p>I moved to the <strong>United States</strong> to pursue a dual master's path in <strong>Information Technology</strong> and <strong>Artificial Intelligence</strong>, funding my own education entirely through freelance work, system administration, and operations roles. No safety net — just the work.</p>
      <blockquote class="pull">I bridge the gap between modern AI solutions and robust IT operations.</blockquote>
      <p>I am now targeting <strong>Cloud, Junior DevOps, and AI roles in Australia</strong> — a region making the most ambitious bets on technology infrastructure in the world. Strong academic foundation combined with the practical mindset of someone who has always had to make things work.</p>
      <div class="edu-list">
        {degrees.map(d => (
          <div class="edu-item">
            <div class="edu-deg">{d.deg}</div>
            <div class="edu-info">{d.school} <span>{d.year}</span></div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
#about { background: var(--bg1); border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
.about-text p  { font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--mid); line-height: 1.95; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
.about-text strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 500; }
.pull {
  margin: 2.2rem 0; padding: 1.6rem 1.6rem 1.6rem 2rem;
  background: var(--dim); border-left: 2px solid var(--blue);
  font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--text); font-style: italic; line-height: 1.65;
}
.edu-list { margin-top: 2.2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .55rem; }
.edu-item {
  padding: 1.2rem 1.6rem; background: var(--bg2);
  border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-left: 2px solid var(--bline);
  transition: border-left-color .25s, transform .3s var(--ease);
}
.edu-item:hover { border-left-color: var(--blue); transform: translateX(6px); }
.edu-deg  { font-family: var(--ff-d); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin-bottom: .3rem; }
.edu-info { font-family: var(--ff-m); font-size: .68rem; color: var(--muted); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .3rem; }
.edu-info span { color: var(--blue); }
</style>
